  },
  {
   "text": "<summary><strong>Chat template</strong></summary>",
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B README.md:L270"
  },
  {
   "text": "LFM3-VL uses this ChatML format, generated from the checkpoint's [chat template](https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B/blob/main/chat_template.jinja):",
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B README.md:L272"
  },
  {
   "text": "Use `processor.apply_chat_template()` with `add_generation_prompt=True` to format messages automatically. The model thinks in a `<think>...</think>` block before it answers.",
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B README.md:L283"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pass function schemas through `tools=...` to `apply_chat_template()`. The template formats tool definitions and results automatically. Generated calls use XML:",
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B README.md:L294"
  },
  {
   "text": "LFM3 supports deferred tools. Set `defer_loading=True` to keep tool definitions out of the prompt until your harness's search tool returns their names as `tool_reference` parts. The chat template then inserts their definitions into `<additional_tools>`.",
   "source": "LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B README.md:L320"
  }
 ],
